xoLApZ41bCVudgwhzDkonW9gE_Q&oe=6AE4C102"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "I\u2019m Having A Bad Day", "keywords": ["SmashGame", "VRDestruction", "PhysicsSandbox", "CartoonChaos", "RealityShow"], "long_description": "Created as a compact and physical VR experience, I\u2019m Having a Bad Day is a cartoon-style game built around a simple idea: breaking things can be fun.\n\nYou play as a contestant in a fictional reality show set across different environments. The goal is simple: smash, dismantle, and create as much controlled chaos as possible within a short time limit.\n\nObjects react with exaggerated cartoon physics and clear visual feedback. Power-ups, such as oversized tools or jelly weapons, temporarily shift the pace and encourage different approaches to destruction.\n\nWhile the game is not designed as a fitness experience, you may find that after demolishing a couple of environments you feel unexpectedly energized especially after a long or stressful day.\n\nI\u2019m Having a Bad Day is a straightforward, physics-driven VR game built around short bursts of action and repeatable levels, created for players who enjoy quick sessions and physical interaction in virtual space.", "short_description": "Smash your stress away in I\u2019m Having a Bad Day, a fast-paced cartoon VR experience where you compete in a chaotic reality show. Break, dismantle and unleash exaggerated physics-driven destruction in short, intense levels. Easy to jump into, hard to stop, perfect for quick sessions and surprisingly energizing fun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.play-sys.com/terms/#privacy_policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.play-sys.com/terms/#terms_of_service", "publisher_name": "PlaySys", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.havingabadday.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "274